      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand how disheartening it must be to see your creative efforts misappropriated, but it's important to remember that art has many faces and the same inspiration can lead to diverse outcomes. While I empathize with your situation, let's find a constructive way to address this issue. Instead of focusing on accusation, consider showcasing your original work, its influence on current artists, and the power of remixing under your shadow. Emphasize the collaborative spirit and art's inherent value over proprietary possessions, and engage directly with fellow creators for mutual support and growth. I don't condone stealing, but working constructively will help raise your work and foster a positive community.",
